Get integration details

Usage: vendo integrations get [OPTIONS] <integrationId>

Arguments:
  <integrationId>  

Options:
      --json            Output raw JSON
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics
  -h, --help            Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo integrations get <integrationId>
  $ vendo int get <integrationId> --json
